' MORE BOARD GAMES
' Three board games (Shogun, Gomoku, Knightsbridge) from Tim Hartnell's
' Giant Book of Computer Games (Ballantine Books, 1984; Interface
' Publications, 1983) on one ColecoVision cartridge, in Amy by Amy
' Bienvenu.
'
' The games themselves are ../sg (Shogun), ../gk (Gomoku) and ../kb
' (Knightsbridge); build.py joins them. See their sources for the rules,
' controls and liberties. Here: a first menu picks the game; each game's
' title has OTHER GAME to come back to it. Keypad not used.

const TQ0ea = 128
